==Battleground==
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Black Thunder Rider (Enemy)|Black Thunder Rider]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

